WEBVTT

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:04.980
Satoshi, who aims to battle
the World Champion, Dande…

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:10.110
And Go, who dreams of catching every Pokémon
to work his way up to Mew…

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:15.440
This is the story of their lives and adventures.

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:32.950
Oh, just the wind?

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:48.400
What was that?!

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:53.450
Renji?!

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:55.570
What happened?

00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:58.180
Satoshi, Go…

00:00:58.180 --> 00:00:59.700
G-Gänger…

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:01.330
It’s back?!

00:01:05.790 --> 00:01:06.850
And that means…

00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:08.570
Another chance!
This time I’ll catch it, for sure!

00:01:08.570 --> 00:01:09.850
I’ll find it first!

00:01:09.850 --> 00:01:11.590
No, I will!

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:16.090
D-Don’t leave me!

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:22.850
PocketMonsters

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:25.270
Hey, you still not ready? C'mon, hurry up!

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:27.850
You all packed and ready to leave?

00:01:27.850 --> 00:01:30.570
I'll show you this wide mysterious world

00:01:30.570 --> 00:01:33.440
And skip the slow send-off

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:35.780
Be it through fire or through water

00:01:35.780 --> 00:01:38.450
I'm fumbling blindly through the days

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:42.950
When I don't even know what the next second will bring

00:01:43.620 --> 00:01:48.210
Each and every one of my memories

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:52.800
Can always be found inside a Ball

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:56.720
On 1, 2, 3, dive in!

00:01:56.720 --> 00:02:02.470
I've got the future plans I imagined in my pocket

00:02:04.430 --> 00:02:09.480
Greeting someone new is always fresh

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:13.690
No need (No need!) to hesitate! Try! (Try!)

00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:15.030
Let's have a fight!

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:17.740
1: Once the battle's done

00:02:17.740 --> 00:02:19.570
2: And we're laughing or crying

00:02:19.570 --> 00:02:23.910
On 3, let's be friends!

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:30.580
Any day and every day, that's always been my rule

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:35.920
With this unpredictable, boundless world awaiting

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:38.420
Let's go! Every time you trip and fall

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:42.550
Let's go! You pick yourself up by my side

00:02:42.550 --> 00:02:44.350
I choose you!

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:53.360
Satoshi is Cursed...!

00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:55.750
Where are you, Gänger?

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:57.310
Not here…

00:02:57.870 --> 00:03:01.800
The temperature should drop
wherever Gänger is.

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:04.350
Satoshi?

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:06.280
It’s nothing.

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:08.010
Over there!

00:03:08.010 --> 00:03:09.000
Yeah!

00:03:10.440 --> 00:03:11.380
Oh, here!

00:03:11.380 --> 00:03:13.750
Kikuna, was that Gänger again?

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:15.180
Y-Yes…

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:17.510
Barrierd?

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:20.230
A book?

00:03:20.230 --> 00:03:21.390
“Gän-Gera-Geh?”

00:03:22.370 --> 00:03:23.840
Tea…

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:25.840
Crash!

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:28.430
Got soaked…

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:30.810
Your broom…

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:32.520
“Gän-Gera-Geh?”

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:34.450
And there you have it.

00:03:34.450 --> 00:03:35.580
There you have <i>what?</i>

00:03:35.580 --> 00:03:37.680
Well anyway, let’s find Gänger!

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:38.610
Right, Pikachu?

00:03:42.990 --> 00:03:44.460
Pikachu!

00:03:46.350 --> 00:03:47.450
Are you okay?

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:49.660
That’s good.

00:03:55.590 --> 00:03:56.310
Ow!

00:03:57.180 --> 00:03:58.040
What?

00:04:00.780 --> 00:04:02.510
Ow! Ow!

00:04:08.710 --> 00:04:09.350
Gänger!

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:12.800
Pikachu, use Electroweb!

00:04:22.230 --> 00:04:24.330
Cut it out!

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:28.790
Huh?

00:04:33.610 --> 00:04:34.900
It ran away?

00:04:38.580 --> 00:04:41.230
Looks like it made
another huge mess…

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:43.540
Let’s all clean it up.

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:44.570
Sure.

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:50.140
Sheesh…

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:52.830
What does that Gänger want to do?

00:04:52.830 --> 00:04:56.460
Does it show up for
some specific reason?

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:59.870
Actually, the person who
showed me this building told me…

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:02.570
...that it was a nasty workplace.

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:04.350
It was a nest of Iwark?!

00:05:04.910 --> 00:05:06.510
A <i>nasty work</i> place.

00:05:09.320 --> 00:05:14.560
He said that, whenever people came by,
poltergeist activity would occur.

00:05:14.560 --> 00:05:17.710
I’m sure Gänger was
living here even back then.

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:21.300
What?! Why would you make
a place like <i>that</i>  into your institute?!

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:23.110
Well…

00:05:23.110 --> 00:05:28.430
I figured having things fall over, the electricity cut out
and doors opening on their own would be fun.

00:05:33.590 --> 00:05:34.690
Oh, dear…

00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:36.720
Right…

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:44.780
A blackout?

00:05:47.100 --> 00:05:48.030
Good grief…

00:06:06.190 --> 00:06:09.970
It always settled down quick,
so I figured it would be all right!

00:06:11.860 --> 00:06:13.220
That’s our director…

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:18.630
Maybe Gänger gave up because
its tricks didn’t work on Director Sakuragi.

00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:22.970
Then why did it start
causing trouble again?

00:06:22.970 --> 00:06:24.360
That’s the rub!

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:29.620
First, Renji and Coil were
attacked in the basement.

00:06:29.620 --> 00:06:31.210
Which means…

00:06:31.210 --> 00:06:33.190
What? It’s my fault?!

00:06:33.190 --> 00:06:35.330
That could be part of it, but…

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:39.580
There’s us, Satoshi, Go,
and all the new Pokémon…

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:42.670
It might not like that
things have gotten so lively.

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:45.500
Yeah! That’s gotta be it!

00:06:46.860 --> 00:06:48.280
Satoshi?

00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:49.760
I feel a chill…

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:53.230
What if you’ve been
cursed by Gänger?

00:06:53.230 --> 00:06:53.970
Cursed?

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:57.790
It’s still not entirely clear
<i>what</i> Gänger is,

00:06:57.790 --> 00:07:00.600
but it might even curse its own trainer,

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:03.230
gradually weaken them,

00:07:03.720 --> 00:07:05.480
until finally…!

00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:07.200
W-W-What?!

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:09.360
That’s just a hypothesis.

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:10.860
Y-Yeah!

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:12.460
There’s no cur—

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:17.070
Satoshi, are you okay?

00:07:17.070 --> 00:07:18.870
Just fine…

00:07:21.510 --> 00:07:22.450
Huh?

00:07:22.450 --> 00:07:24.070
You look pale.

00:07:24.070 --> 00:07:25.300
No, I’m fine!

00:07:26.580 --> 00:07:27.750
That’s a flower vase!

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:32.180
Come on…
What are you doing?

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:35.880
He really is cursed! I knew it!

00:07:35.880 --> 00:07:38.930
Oh, Renji, you exaggerate!

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:43.660
Whoa!

00:07:43.660 --> 00:07:45.820
H-H-H-Hey?!

00:08:09.580 --> 00:08:13.790
I really do think
something is going on here.

00:08:13.790 --> 00:08:16.890
Oh, come on, there’s no curse!

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:18.380
But Satoshi…

00:08:18.380 --> 00:08:20.240
I’m totally fine!

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:36.730
No big deal!

00:08:36.730 --> 00:08:40.750
This’ll all go away with
some physical activity!

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:41.580
Satoshi?!

00:08:44.170 --> 00:08:45.530
Come on, Hibunny!

00:09:05.180 --> 00:09:07.310
Running sure helped,
right, Pikachu?

00:09:18.920 --> 00:09:21.090
It’s the brat boy and
Pikachu, meow!

00:09:21.090 --> 00:09:22.720
What? What was that?!

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:28.110
Ow…

00:09:35.730 --> 00:09:37.350
I’m sorry!

00:09:37.350 --> 00:09:38.260
Watch yourself!

00:09:38.980 --> 00:09:42.210
What’s this? You still cursed?

00:09:42.960 --> 00:09:46.840
That was <i>three years ago</i>.
I’m as lucky as it gets!

00:09:46.840 --> 00:09:48.520
There’s no stupid curse.

00:09:49.110 --> 00:09:49.820
Satoshi!

00:09:49.820 --> 00:09:53.030
But it sure was awful
back when <i>it</i>  was around.

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:57.190
I couldn’t win any battles,
and all my attempts at catching Pokémon failed…

00:09:57.190 --> 00:09:59.950
I’d fall down the stairs
or lose things…

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:02.320
I had bad luck
with everything I did.

00:10:02.320 --> 00:10:05.270
That’s hilarious!
That’s what we call a curse!

00:10:05.270 --> 00:10:08.970
That plague has left me!
My luck’s perfect now!

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:16.160
You wait here, okay?

00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:18.900
Don’t go anywhere, you hear?!

00:10:58.280 --> 00:11:00.720
You wait here, okay?

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:04.010
Don’t go anywhere, you hear?!

00:11:17.460 --> 00:11:19.680
Here you go.

00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:44.510
I’ll be cursed!

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:59.740
I swear… I never should have
caught that miserable Gänger.

00:12:03.020 --> 00:12:03.750
Gänger?!

00:12:03.750 --> 00:12:04.910
This is where you were?!

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:07.120
W-Why are you…?!

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:11.250
Gänger!

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:13.480
PocketMonsters

00:12:13.480 --> 00:12:15.120
Pocket Monsters!
PocketMonsters

00:12:15.120 --> 00:12:19.420
PocketMonsters

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:24.340
Poison
. Ghost .
Gänger
PocketMonsters

00:12:29.030 --> 00:12:30.810
W-What? No way!

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:34.140
Stop it, Gänger!
That’s your trainer, right?

00:12:36.990 --> 00:12:38.230
Pikachu! Electroweb!

00:12:43.640 --> 00:12:45.030
Calm down, already!

00:12:45.510 --> 00:12:47.740
That Gänger is yours, right?!

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:49.240
You should listen to…

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:50.120
Satoshi, look out!

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:52.000
Stay away! Stay away!
<i>Stay away!</i>

00:12:54.230 --> 00:12:56.380
I told you to wait there,
didn’t I?

00:12:56.380 --> 00:12:59.090
Nothing but trouble comes my way
when <i>you’re</i> around!

00:12:59.090 --> 00:13:00.710
I’ve had enough of you!

00:13:02.470 --> 00:13:04.010
That’s just cruel!

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:06.330
Shut up, shut up... shut up!

00:13:06.330 --> 00:13:08.400
Hey, wait!

00:13:08.400 --> 00:13:08.890
Hey!

00:13:12.340 --> 00:13:13.500
Gänger…

00:13:17.380 --> 00:13:21.360
Being abandoned by its trainer
must’ve been shocking.

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:24.240
Satoshi!

00:13:24.670 --> 00:13:26.050
I’ll find Gänger!

00:13:26.050 --> 00:13:27.570
I can’t leave it like this!

00:13:32.980 --> 00:13:35.580
Yeah, I should have figured…
That’s so you, Satoshi.

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:43.110
I-I was just thinking
I might try to catch Gänger!

00:13:43.110 --> 00:13:45.570
It’s not like I want to
help Satoshi out or anything!

00:13:47.320 --> 00:13:49.610
Hibunny, let’s find Gänger!

00:13:51.720 --> 00:13:53.960
I want that Gänger.

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:55.800
It looks pretty tough.

00:13:55.800 --> 00:13:57.350
It’ll be ours, meow.

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:12.410
Hey, excuse me?
You, Gänger over there.

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:16.580
Would you like to
follow the path of evil with us?

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:20.200
I heard what happened to you, meow.

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:23.000
I really feel ya, meow.

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:27.340
You should forget that nasty trainer
and team up with us, meow!

00:14:27.340 --> 00:14:30.480
Just use your power
without restraint,

00:14:30.480 --> 00:14:32.850
and blow up
anyone that bothers you!

00:14:38.180 --> 00:14:42.440
It’s saying “You’re not fooling me.
I won’t trust filthy humans!”, meow.

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:44.730
It <i>really</i> doesn't
trust humans, huh?

00:14:44.730 --> 00:14:47.940
Quit whining and come with us!

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:49.320
Yeah!

00:14:57.790 --> 00:15:01.120
You’re wasting your time!
We came prepared for you!

00:15:02.340 --> 00:15:05.300
Its distrust of humans
is growing stronger, meow.

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:09.350
Who cares?
As long as we catch it, we win.

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:14.010
Iron Tail!

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:21.590
You okay, Gänger?

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:24.110
The brat boy!

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:26.480
Team Rocket!
What are you up to?!

00:15:27.740 --> 00:15:29.740
We were so close!

00:15:30.530 --> 00:15:33.200
Gänger, will you
help me battle them?

00:15:35.820 --> 00:15:38.000
Hey, Satoshi?

00:15:38.900 --> 00:15:41.030
Never mind what
your old trainer said...

00:15:41.030 --> 00:15:44.130
I need you right now!

00:15:46.030 --> 00:15:47.320
C’mon, Gänger!

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:54.640
Hey! Don't just carry on
like we're not here!

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:56.480
That Gänger belongs to us!

00:15:56.480 --> 00:16:00.830
Yeah, meow! Besides, that Gänger
doesn’t trust humans anymore, meow!

00:16:02.950 --> 00:16:05.680
You don’t have to
trust me right away.

00:16:05.680 --> 00:16:07.860
I trust you!

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:16.910
You’ll help me, Gänger?

00:16:21.920 --> 00:16:23.750
Why’d you go to him?!

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:24.950
Well in that case…

00:16:24.950 --> 00:16:25.720
Yeah!

00:16:25.720 --> 00:16:27.790
Vending, come on!

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:37.540
Here we go, Nyarth!

00:16:37.540 --> 00:16:38.890
Bring it, meow!

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:40.140
Rocket…

00:16:40.540 --> 00:16:41.430
Vending…

00:16:41.430 --> 00:16:43.160
Secret!

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:45.810
Here it comes!

00:16:45.810 --> 00:16:47.610
We got two!

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:49.320
Throw ’em, already, meow!

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:52.180
You’re up!

00:16:52.180 --> 00:16:52.810
Come forth!

00:16:56.870 --> 00:16:59.660
The Beckon Pokémon,
Samayouru!

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:02.210
Huh? They’re both Samayouru?

00:17:02.210 --> 00:17:03.920
Ya got a problem with Sakaki?

00:17:03.920 --> 00:17:05.850
Not at all, meow!

00:17:05.850 --> 00:17:09.100
Samayouru. Beckon Pokémon.
Ghost type.

00:17:09.100 --> 00:17:13.220
It sucks drifting will-o’-the-wisps into its body.
What happens inside is a mystery.

00:17:13.220 --> 00:17:16.550
All Ghost types…
You got this, right, Gänger?

00:17:18.560 --> 00:17:21.730
We’ll take both
Gänger and Pikachu!

00:17:21.730 --> 00:17:23.140
Samayouru!
Shadow Strike!

00:17:24.990 --> 00:17:26.310
Dodge it with Lightning Speed!

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:29.320
Ice Punch!

00:17:38.020 --> 00:17:38.740
It attacked Pikachu?!

00:17:43.920 --> 00:17:45.420
Thanks, Gänger!

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:48.330
Oh, that’s what it was…

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:49.460
Fire Punch!

00:17:50.800 --> 00:17:51.630
Gänger!

00:17:53.430 --> 00:17:55.300
Night Head!

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:00.220
It countered with
another Night Head?

00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:01.810
Fire Punch!

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:05.650
Pikachu!

00:18:05.650 --> 00:18:06.930
Now, Night Head!

00:18:12.030 --> 00:18:13.650
Oh no! They’re taking a beating!

00:18:13.650 --> 00:18:15.330
Go, go!

00:18:15.330 --> 00:18:16.630
Nice work!

00:18:16.630 --> 00:18:17.530
Gänger!

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:25.560
Samayouru!

00:18:25.560 --> 00:18:28.710
Oh, they got pushed back, meow!

00:18:31.090 --> 00:18:33.340
Wha—?! It vanished?!

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:41.100
Gänger, use Shadow Ball!

00:18:49.320 --> 00:18:51.570
It was going <i>so</i> well at first!

00:18:51.570 --> 00:18:53.830
I thought it didn’t trust humans!

00:18:53.830 --> 00:18:55.740
We’ve been tricked, meow!

00:18:58.310 --> 00:19:00.800
<i>What an awful feeling!</i>

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:07.280
Amazing! You teamed up
with Gänger and actually won?!

00:19:07.280 --> 00:19:08.710
Gänger did all the work.

00:19:09.850 --> 00:19:11.460
Thanks, Gänger!

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:16.340
Now, let’s go back
to the institute.

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:28.230
Satoshi?!

00:19:28.780 --> 00:19:31.210
I… I…

00:19:33.640 --> 00:19:37.970
Satoshi… Satoshi…
Satoshi!

00:19:45.940 --> 00:19:47.710
You okay, Satoshi?

00:19:48.690 --> 00:19:49.790
Yeah…

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:52.820
You didn’t realize you had a fever?

00:19:54.430 --> 00:19:55.880
Sorry.

00:19:55.880 --> 00:20:00.790
Well, I should apologize for
chalking it up to Gänger’s curse, too.

00:20:00.790 --> 00:20:02.750
That’s right!
Where’s Gänger?!

00:20:02.750 --> 00:20:03.670
Ow!

00:20:05.120 --> 00:20:06.180
An apple?

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:07.890
Is it… worried about you?

00:20:09.250 --> 00:20:10.350
Gänger?

00:20:13.610 --> 00:20:15.150
A Monster Ball?

00:20:15.770 --> 00:20:17.650
This must mean…

00:20:18.330 --> 00:20:19.440
Gänger!

00:20:26.410 --> 00:20:29.410
Gänger, be my partner!

00:20:48.500 --> 00:20:50.520
I got Gänger!

00:20:52.600 --> 00:20:55.720
I wanted that Gänger, too…

00:20:57.250 --> 00:20:58.300
Come out!

00:21:01.710 --> 00:21:03.260
I’ll be counting on you.

00:21:04.340 --> 00:21:05.260
Gänger?

00:21:07.890 --> 00:21:08.920
Hey?!

00:21:11.140 --> 00:21:13.480
Hey, Gänger?

00:21:13.480 --> 00:21:17.040
It’s probably telling you to
eat those and get better fast!

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:19.080
I guess.

